onality remains governing.\n\nArchitecture: pure shared operation/outcome/grant derivation and separate off-queue authority reads, commit judgments and effect owners are useful boundaries. Durable send marks and immutable entries remain distinct from transport bookkeeping. The restart and reply paths must retain that separation.\nSecurity: required common evidence shape is distinct from provider authentication. Real membership/genesis/filter forms, keys/member/rules/observed and platform rule joining remain explicitly owned. Missing P22 now fails the whole production inbox definition closed. Grant replay and cross-run highest-head folding are still owed; ED12's \"a replay finds it\" is prospective at this head, not current replay behavior. ED16 numbers count read beginnings; reused observations do not imply monotonically rising numbers in all retained entries.\nSimplification: use one Evidence guard and bounded cursor/reply mechanisms within existing components. No extra engine, duplicate commission, benchmark quota or scope reduction.\n\nNonblocking wording: M1's \"Every act\" milestone table should name the delivered authority/founding acts, because rules/check/publication behaviors stay M3/M4. ED11 explicitly owns reuse of a late read for a later act; no new undisclosed bypass is filed for it. ED6 controller classification remains an explicit design seam.\n\nFull I3/R1/R3/C2, actual supported operation openings and owners, five capacity dimensions, IA/recovery/browser/device/provider/removal and whole comparable-cost 10x duties remain open. Previously landed f321/6acf test-economy code and producer timings/pass counts are not independent current execution evidence. No tests, gate, build, install, typecheck, project script/import, evaluator, protocol simulation, private diagnostic, provider/account action or source edit was performed. Six private cloud-review script bodies remain unopened. A later ordinary exact-head invitation and review are required.","body":{"f